OL,3,AAI data centres are booming in
OL,4,AAustralia - but at what cost?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralia has quickly become a global
OL,7,Fdestination for data centres, with
OL,8,Finvestors attracted to the country's
OL,9,Fabundance of clean energy, natural gas
OL,10,Freserves, and land to power and house
OL,11,Ftheir technologies.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
