OL,3,AAmelia Dimoldenberg to close doors of
OL,4,AChicken Shop Date
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmelia Dimoldenberg has announced she
OL,7,Fwill end Chicken Shop Date after more
OL,8,Fthan a decade.
OL,10,FThe presenter, known for her
OL,11,Foff-the-wall questions and deadpan
OL,12,Fsilences, revealed the news in an
OL,13,FInstagram post.
OL,15,FShe has become one of the UK's
OL,16,Fbest-known content creators through the
OL,17,Fweb series, which features interviews
OL,18,Fwith rappers, actors and celebrities
OL,19,Fframed as a "date" with the host.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
